    "description": "DECISION-02 was closed during the Jul 28 reconciliation but the underlying decision is still outstanding and BLOCKS BUILD-34 (fraud Dismissed automation).\n\nQuestions for Wagertech (also added to the shared Open Questions doc):\n\n1\\. Should flagging a Sign Up auto-set the Player's status to 'Flagged for Fraud' — and at which point (rep Suspected vs Ops Confirmed)?\n\n2\\. Player with multiple Sign Ups, only one fraud-flagged — what should Player status be?\n\n3\\. On Dismissed, should Player status auto-revert, and to what?\n\nJumpr proposal: tie Player status to Ops-CONFIRMED fraud only; auto-revert on Dismissed only if no other Confirmed-fraud Sign Ups.\n\nStatus: awaiting client feedback via Open Questions doc.",
