          "id": "10324",
          "body": "**Duplicate of DECISION-02 (WAGR-101) — recommend closing this one and keeping DECISION-02 as the single thread.**\n\nBoth cards ask the same question, which is also Open Questions **Q6** — still the only formally pending item in that doc, with **no comment activity at all** since it was written.\n\nJumpr's proposal on the table, unanswered: _\"Player status changes are manual for Phase 1 and can be automated in later phases once processes are fully tested.\"_\n\nThree sub-questions Wagertech still owes an answer on:\n\n1. Should a fraud-flagged Sign Up automatically set the Player's status — and at which point, rep-flags-Suspected or Ops-confirms?\n\n1. If a Player has multiple Sign Ups and only one is fraud-flagged, what is the Player's status?\n\n1. On Dismissed, does the Player's status revert automatically?\n\n**Recommendation:** write the build to the manual/Phase-1 assumption and note it as unratified, rather than holding. If Wagertech never answers, manual is the safe default and costs nothing to reverse later.",
          "created": "2026-08-10T13:10:21.289-0400",
          "updated": "2026-08-10T13:10:21.289-0400",
          "jsdPublic": true
        }
